   "Skill_1006304_SkillResume": "Casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Eternal Bloom</color> additionally restores Concerto Energy.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> additionally restores Concerto Energy.",
   "Skill_1006305_SkillDescribe": "While a nearby active Resonator has 50% or more HP, Lily grants them 10% DMG Reduction.\nWhen a Resonator in the team takes a fatal blow, they will not fall and will instead gain a Shield equal to 10% of Lily's Max HP for 10s. This effect can be triggered once every 5 min.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> grants Lily <color=Highlight>Floral Blessing</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Floral Blessing</color></size>\nLasts for 60s. When the HP of a surviving Resonator in the team is below 50% of their Max HP, restore 50% of their Max HP and remove <color=Highlight>Floral Blessing</color>. This effect can be triggered once every 120s.",
   "Skill_1006305_SkillName": "Flowers for You",
-  "Skill_1006305_SkillResume": "While the active Resonator has high HP, Lily grants them DMG Reduction.\nWhen a Resonator in the team takes a fatal blow, they will not be downed and will instead gain a Shield.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> grants Lily <color=Highlight>Floral Blessing</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Floral Blessing</color></size>\nWhen a Resonator in the team has low HP, restore their HP.",
+  "Skill_1006305_SkillResume": "While the nearby active Resonator has high HP, Lily grants them DMG Reduction.\nWhen a Resonator in the team takes a fatal blow, they will not be downed and will instead gain a Shield.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> grants Lily <color=Highlight>Floral Blessing</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Floral Blessing</color></size>\nWhen a Resonator in the team has low HP, restore their HP.",
   "Skill_1006306_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>First Bloom</color></size>\nAttack the target, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>. {Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to cast Basic Attack Stage 3.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Eternal Bloom</color></size>\nAfter casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Into the Dream Cradle</color>, Lily's next Intro Skill <color=Highlight>First Bloom</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Eternal Bloom</color>. When cast, it attacks the target, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nFor every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 100%, this skill gains 0.5% Crit. Rate, up to 80%, and 1% Crit. DMG, up to 160%.\nCasting this skill grants <color=Highlight>Deep Dream Fragrance</color> for 8s. Casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> consumes <color=Highlight>Deep Dream Fragrance</color> to additionally grant 100 points of <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color>.\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to cast Basic Attack Stage 3.",
   "Skill_1006306_SkillName": "Blooming Dream",
-  "Skill_1006306_SkillResume": "<size=40><color=Title>First Bloom</color></size>\nAttack the target, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Eternal Bloom</color></size>\nWhile <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Into the Dream Cradle</color> is active, Lily's Intro Skill <color=Highlight>First Bloom</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Eternal Bloom</color>. When cast, it attacks the target, dealing greater <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nAfter the skill is cast, casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> additionally grants 100 points of <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color>.",
-  "Skill_1006307_MultiSkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Dream Perfume</color></size>\nCan hold up to 300 points.\n<color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color>, <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack</color>, and <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter</color> restore <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> when dealing damage.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Reverie Blend</color> or <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Nightmare Blend</color> restores 130 points of <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color>.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Eternal Bloom</color> restores 130 points of <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> is full, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color>, consuming all <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> to grant 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Dream Shelter</color>. During the skill, Lily pulls in nearby targets and continuously deals <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to them. She also heals all Resonators in the team every second for 2s.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> grants Lily <color=Highlight>Wish of Praying Dream</color>.\nSwitching to another Resonator during <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> ends the skill immediately.\nLily continuously gains <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> during the skill.\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> reaches 300 points, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to end the skill immediately and cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color>. <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> is automatically cast at the end of <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color>. Casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> consumes all <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color></size>\nAttack targets within range, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nFor every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 100%, this skill gains 0.5% Crit. Rate, up to 80%, and 1% Crit. DMG, up to 160%.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> is full, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color>, consuming all <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> to grant 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Dream Shelter</color>. During the skill, Lily pulls in nearby targets and continuously deals <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to them. She also heals all Resonators in the team every second for 2s.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> grants Lily <color=Highlight>Wish of Praying Dream</color>.\nSwitching to another Resonator during <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> ends the skill immediately.\nLily continuously gains <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> during the skill.\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> reaches 300 points, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to end the skill immediately and cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color>. <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> is automatically cast at the end of <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color>. Casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> consumes all <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color></size>\nAttack targets within range, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nFor every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 100%, this skill gains 0.5% Crit. Rate, up to 80%, and 1% Crit. DMG, up to 160%.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Dream Shelter</color></size>\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> grants 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Dream Shelter</color>, stacking up to 1 time. Receiving damage from an enemy target consumes 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Dream Shelter</color> to grant Lily immunity to interruption and reduce the DMG taken by 60% for 1s. This effect can be triggered once per second.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Wish of Praying Dream</color></size>\nCan be gained once every 25s.\nWhen Lily has <color=Highlight>Wish of Praying Dream</color>, the current <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> consumes <color=Highlight>Wish of Praying Dream</color> to increase the skill's healing by 400%.",
-  "Skill_1006307_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Dream Perfume</color></size>\nCan hold up to 300 points.\n<color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color>, <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack</color>, and <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter</color> restore <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> when dealing damage.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Reverie Blend</color> or <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Nightmare Blend</color> restores 130 points of <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color>.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Eternal Bloom</color> restores 130 points of <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Dreambell Chime</color></size>\nCan hold up to 300 points.\nCan be gained continuously during <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> and <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color>. Any unconsumed <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> will be converted into an equal amount of <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> is full, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color>, consuming all <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> to grant 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Dream Shelter</color>. During the skill, Lily pulls in nearby targets and continuously deals <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to them. She also heals all Resonators in the team every second for 2s.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> grants Lily <color=Highlight>Wish of Praying Dream</color>.\nSwitching to another Resonator during <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> ends the skill immediately.\nLily continuously gains <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> and Concerto Energy (up to 30 points) during the skill.\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> reaches 300 points, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to end the skill immediately and cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color>. <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> is automatically cast at the end of <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color>. Casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> consumes all <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color></size>\nAttack targets within range, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nFor every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 100%, this skill gains 0.5% Crit. Rate, up to 80%, and 1% Crit. DMG, up to 160%.\nLily gains <color=Highlight>Sillage</color> for 6s while casting this skill. Casting Outro Skill consumes <color=Highlight>Sillage</color> and grants <color=Highlight><te href=151202>Silvered Dream</te></color> to Resonators in the team. This effect can be triggered once every 20s.\nLily cannot be switched out while casting this skill.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> is full, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color>, consuming all <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> to grant 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Dream Shelter</color>. During the skill, Lily pulls in nearby targets and continuously deals <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to them. She also heals all Resonators in the team every second for 2s.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> grants Lily <color=Highlight>Wish of Praying Dream</color>.\nSwitching to another Resonator during <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> ends the skill immediately.\nLily continuously gains <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> and Concerto Energy (up to 30 points) during the skill.\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> reaches 300 points, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to end the skill immediately and cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color>. <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> is automatically cast at the end of <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color>. Casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> consumes all <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color></size>\nAttack targets within range, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nFor every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 100%, this skill gains 0.5% Crit. Rate, up to 80%, and 1% Crit. DMG, up to 160%.\nLily gains <color=Highlight>Sillage</color> for 6s while casting this skill. Casting Outro Skill consumes <color=Highlight>Sillage</color> and grants <color=Highlight><te href=151202>Silvered Dream</te></color> to Resonators in the team. This effect can be triggered once every 20s.\nLily cannot be switched out while casting this skill.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Silvered Dream</color></size>\nLasts for 30s.\nWhen the Resonator with this effect is the active Resonator and can trigger Unison Response, each stack of <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color> on the team increases their ATK by 0.1% for every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 190%, up to 7%, counting up to 4 stacks of <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color>.\nThe active Resonator's Echo Skill Crit. Rate and Echo Skill Crit. DMG are increased. For every 0.7% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 190%, Echo Skill Crit. Rate is increased by 0.1%, up to 10%, and Echo Skill Crit. DMG is increased by 0.2%, up to 20%.\nAll Resonators in the team gain increased resistance to interruption.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Dream Shelter</color></size>\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> grants 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Dream Shelter</color>, stacking up to 1 time. <color=Highlight>Dream Shelter</color> is removed when <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> ends, or when <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> is interrupted. Receiving damage from an enemy target consumes 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Dream Shelter</color> to grant Lily immunity to interruption and reduce the DMG taken by 60% for 1s. This effect can be triggered once per second.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Wish of Praying Dream</color></size>\nCan be gained once every 25s.\nWhen Lily has <color=Highlight>Wish of Praying Dream</color>, the current <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> consumes <color=Highlight>Wish of Praying Dream</color> to increase the skill's healing by 400%.",
+  "Skill_1006306_SkillResume": "<size=40><color=Title>First Bloom</color></size>\nAttack the target, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Eternal Bloom</color></size>\nAfter casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Into the Dream Cradle</color>, Lily's Intro Skill <color=Highlight>First Bloom</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Eternal Bloom</color>. When cast, it attacks the target, dealing greater <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nAfter the skill is cast, casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> additionally grants 100 points of <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color>.",
