   "SolarSchoolItemDescription_15": "A simply designed necklace set with a clear, brilliant gemstone. Its color evokes a cloudless sky, leaving your mind feeling just as clear.\nIncreases Thinking when obtained.",
   "SolarSchoolItemDescription_16": "After you got Buling to publish a \"legendary post\" on the forum, you became a school legend. Someone gave you this oddly familiar-looking item as a token of admiration.\nFor some reason, carrying it seems to increase your Popularity.",
