   "SolarSchoolItemDescription_20": "A gift from Changli. \nBehind her composed smile, she keeps her true feelings hidden, content to wander alone at the edges of the crowd. Yet all she really longs for is the warmth of companionship, the simple joy of being among friends, and a heart that no longer has to face the world alone.",
   "SolarSchoolItemDescription_21": "A gift from Cartethyia. \nIf you can't do something, work hard until you can. If you want something, go out and claim it! Her earnestness has an endearingly awkward edge, but she never holds back. And when she finally reached the end of her determined sprint, it was your hand she grasped.",
