   "SolarSchoolItemDescription_25": "A brooch styled after Changli, awarded for reaching the max level in the <b>Student Council</b>.\nAnswering student emails, organizing campus events, standing up for students' rights, and bringing people together... For many students, the Student Council is a place to turn when they need support.",
   "SolarSchoolItemDescription_26": "[Spring Exclusive] Green tea made from tender spring buds and infused with the delicate fragrance of jasmine. Each sip leaves a sweet aftertaste, with floral notes that linger on the palate.\nThe tea leaves it uses is extremely rare. It will probably take 28 days to restock the item...",
